WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.570
 *cheery music plays*

00:00:04.570 --> 00:00:05.710
Hi ladies.

00:00:05.710 --> 00:00:10.280
 

00:00:10.280 --> 00:00:24.660
 

00:00:24.660 --> 00:00:29.000
Hey baby. Why don't you smile for me? Huh? Just gimme a little smile. Come on!

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:34.940
 

00:00:34.940 --> 00:00:39.050
Hey Neddy! I need five copies of this. Thanks.

00:00:39.050 --> 00:00:45.900
Hey Ned. Sorry to bother you. Could you do me a huge favor? I need five copies of this? That'd be great. Thanks! 

00:00:45.900 --> 00:00:47.040
Hey Lauren!

00:00:47.040 --> 00:00:48.860
Hey Caitlin! Your hair looks amazing!

00:00:48.860 --> 00:00:50.690
Aww! Thank you!

00:00:50.690 --> 00:00:51.600
Hey Buddy!

00:00:51.600 --> 00:00:52.520
Hey what's up?

00:00:52.520 --> 00:00:54.340
Hey man have you been working out? You look good.

00:00:54.340 --> 00:00:57.540
Uhh...Yeah actually. Thanks.

00:00:57.540 --> 00:01:00.280
 

00:01:00.280 --> 00:01:02.110
That's so cool. I'm so glad.

00:01:02.110 --> 00:01:04.620
Hey. What's going on with that guy Brian?

00:01:04.620 --> 00:01:06.440
Oh we're not really talking anymore.

00:01:06.440 --> 00:01:09.190
Oh my God! What happened? Let's talk about it.

00:01:09.190 --> 00:01:11.930
Yeah... Yeah. Last Monday was when it got really weird...

00:01:11.930 --> 00:01:16.040
Hey so I haven't seen Amanda around lately. You guys alright?

00:01:16.040 --> 00:01:21.520
We're not really talking at the moment. 

00:01:21.520 --> 00:01:22.660
So guys... another round?

00:01:22.660 --> 00:01:23.110
Yes.

00:01:23.110 --> 00:01:24.260
Cheesecake?

00:01:24.260 --> 00:01:24.710
Yes.

00:01:24.710 --> 00:01:25.630
Awesome!

00:01:25.630 --> 00:01:26.770
Umm...

00:01:26.770 --> 00:01:27.680
No I think I'm ok.

00:01:27.680 --> 00:01:28.140
What?

00:01:28.140 --> 00:01:29.050
Don't be ridiculous!

00:01:29.050 --> 00:01:31.330
I'm sort of watching my weight a little bit.

00:01:31.560 --> 00:01:33.850
Dude. Come on. He's in. I'm in.

00:01:33.850 --> 00:01:34.990
Come on.

00:01:34.990 --> 00:01:37.500
Ok! Cheesecake! Happy?

00:01:37.500 --> 00:01:38.180
Perfect!

00:01:38.180 --> 00:01:39.330
Ok. Yeah.

00:01:39.330 --> 00:01:40.920
2 more rounds!

00:01:40.920 --> 00:01:42.070
3 more rounds!

00:01:42.070 --> 00:01:42.980
Ooo!

00:01:42.980 --> 00:01:44.810
I'm so happy.

00:01:44.810 --> 00:01:47.090
*laughter*

00:01:47.090 --> 00:01:50.510
*street sounds*

00:01:50.510 --> 00:01:51.880
Are you sure you're not cold?

00:01:51.880 --> 00:01:53.710
No. I want you to have it.

00:01:53.710 --> 00:01:56.680
So how was your day?

00:01:56.680 --> 00:01:58.050
Good.

00:01:58.050 --> 00:01:59.420
How was yours?

00:01:59.420 --> 00:02:01.250
Good. Just a day.

00:02:01.250 --> 00:02:14.490
*Cheery music plays*

00:02:14.490 --> 00:02:16.770
Music ends.

